    },
    "6": {
      "note": "On converted memory a role agent that wrote none of the leaf's cards or records checks every changed card, sidecar and record statement by statement before closeout; judgment history belongs in content-bound Curator rows and a counted card edit alone never closes a trace.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "anchor": {
