    "9": {
      "note": "The stage ends when task knowledge is written and checked and quality is clean, distinguishing installed-writer publication from scoped manual provenance; own faulty-input refusals and coherence findings are repaired through the same writer, and open permission prompts, other correct-input refusals, unowned state and requirement-meaning questions stop the work.",
